Go away!

261
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:44,460
I'll make you pay, Doomcoffs!

262
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:45,930
Kingy!

263
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,050
My tree!

264
00:16:50,540 --> 00:16:53,000
Keep going straight and don't look back!

265
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:55,320
Son of a bitch!

266
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:57,820
Nami, how do you have that?

267
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,657
I thought they took Mola's
Beaver Card away from you.

268
00:17:00,740 --> 00:17:01,817
They thought so too.

269
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:03,580
Turns out, I cut it in half.

270
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:04,660
Wow, smart!

271
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,700
This tree is swift.

272
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:10,957
And since he's the master of the seducing
woods, he can cut a path straight through.

273
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:15,060
All right, tree, head for the
sunny, full speed! Go, tree!

274
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:18,327
You guys are like a
plague upon this kingdom!

275
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:21,008
My only consolation is
not helping you live.

276
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,620
Sorry, what was that?

277
00:17:22,820 --> 00:17:23,702
Thanks, Adnasi!

278
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:26,000
You better not talk back to Nami!

279
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:35,940
Okay, targets are
sighted and within range.

280
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:37,440
Full speed ahead!

281
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,900
Look behind us! Enemies!

282
00:17:45,380 --> 00:17:46,560
Now charge!

283
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:51,897
Step one in, King Bells!

284
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:53,804
I'm going to spawn since I can!

285
00:17:53,940 --> 00:17:56,697
You get caught and I'll
tear you apart at the scene!

286
00:17:56,780 --> 00:17:57,680
You scare me.

287
00:18:01,900 --> 00:18:04,240
Something just passed over our heads.

288
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:09,120
Did you know that laugh already?

289
00:18:14,360 --> 00:18:19,980
I've come for my wedding day.

290
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:24,300
Let's make mom.

291
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:29,977
Where is it?

292
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:35,060
Meanwhile, near the Juice River,
on the outskirts of Sweet City...

293
00:18:37,460 --> 00:18:38,290
Oh!

294
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,760
I see it!

295
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:41,100
The Juice River.

296
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:45,288
Hopefully the shark submerge
will still be moored over there.

297
00:18:45,820 --> 00:18:46,940
It's up ahead?

298
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:51,500
Uh-oh!

299
00:18:52,380 --> 00:18:55,145
Why is the whole river
filled with heavy cream?

300
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:57,020
Wow! Yummy!

301
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:01,360
No way!

302
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:03,360
I gotta try!

303
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,220
It's incredible!

304
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:10,317
I find it hard to believe
that the debris made it

305
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:13,341
this far when the Whole
Cake Shit toppled over.

306
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:17,220
It's so good!

307
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:20,780
I'm not sure how to
free the shark submerge.

308
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:22,300
Wait, Chopper!

309
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:39,587
I think Mom's gonna
reach us in a second now!

310
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,460
Why did she come out here?

311
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,059
Something's wrong.

312
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,577
Did you get a look at her?

313
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:47,777
Don't tell me it's her hunger pains.

314
00:19:47,860 --> 00:19:50,640
Where's my wedding cake Straw Hat?

315
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:53,200
Hurry up, King Balm!

316
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:54,280
Shake her off!

317
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:55,560
The cow!

318
00:20:00,340 --> 00:20:02,060
You'll be skewered!

319
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:04,580
The Spear of Elbeth shall pierce you!

320
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:05,840
Wait, Elbeth?

321
00:20:09,740 --> 00:20:11,440
Everyone get ready!

322
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:24,140
Let me go!

323
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:41,780
Oh, my God.

324
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:28,900
Where is my cake?

325
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:34,064
That's...like the special
move those Giants did!

326
00:21:40,700 --> 00:21:41,880
But why?

327
00:21:42,940 --> 00:21:44,440
Hey, King-Bomb!

328
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:51,980
Forgive me, Mama, my branches are tied!

329
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:54,946
These awful pirates are
forcing me to do this!

330
00:21:56,320 --> 00:21:58,300
No, here she comes again!

331
00:21:58,840 --> 00:22:00,100
Come on, let's fight!

332
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,951
Hey, Kingbaum, who's that tree back there?

333
00:22:03,060 --> 00:22:04,531
Was that your girlfriend?

334
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:09,000
Oh, Kingy, thanks, Dial.

335
00:22:09,540 --> 00:22:12,240
But I'm worried, you're hurt.

336
00:22:13,020 --> 00:22:13,850
Kingy!

337
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,160
Lady Tree!

338
00:22:16,420 --> 00:22:19,380
Nein, she's my tree-on-sing!

339
00:22:20,120 --> 00:22:21,360
How romantic!

340
00:22:22,980 --> 00:22:25,700
We were going to set up roots together!

341
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:27,060
It was destiny!

342
00:22:28,380 --> 00:22:29,210
Then live!

343
00:22:29,293 --> 00:22:30,440
Live for her sake!

344
00:22:34,860 --> 00:22:38,640
You want to see her again,
don't you? Fight! Don't die!

345
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:49,620
Ya'll do it!

346
00:22:49,820 --> 00:22:52,940
For future I have to! Then run!

347
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:54,219
Run like the wind!

348
00:22:54,420 --> 00:22:56,780
Once we're safe, you can be together!

349
00:22:57,020 --> 00:22:58,500
For today and tomorrow!

350
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:01,400
In sweet matrimony forevermore!

351
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,070
Yaaaaaaah!

352
00:23:04,760 --> 00:23:05,590
Planetry!

353
00:23:07,060 --> 00:23:07,890
Nice.

354
00:23:09,580 --> 00:23:11,060
She's diabolical.

355
00:23:11,180 --> 00:23:12,240
That's our doggy!

356
00:23:12,540 --> 00:23:14,420
I want wedding cake!

357
00:23:15,060 --> 00:23:15,890
Okay!

358
00:23:16,100 --> 00:23:18,180
Looks like it's my turn! Ruby! No!

359
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,340
I have an idea!

360
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:22,457
On my case...

361
00:23:22,540 --> 00:23:23,680
I said my turn!

362
00:23:26,340 --> 00:23:27,170
Now!

363
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:29,470
Black ball!

364
00:23:34,780 --> 00:23:37,037
Lightning, love! Other lightning!

365
00:23:37,120 --> 00:23:38,740
It's up!

366
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,320
Got it!

367
00:23:54,020 --> 00:23:54,850
Mama!

368
00:23:57,220 --> 00:23:58,050
Bombay!

369
00:23:59,320 --> 00:24:01,340
Have you lost your mind, Zeus?

370
00:24:02,500 --> 00:24:05,340
Great, he's totally spaced out. Mama!

371
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:07,617
We're going to lose them in the woods!

372
00:24:07,700 --> 00:24:08,530
Get up!

373
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:11,020
Come back here with my cake!

374
00:24:12,500 --> 00:24:15,147
Once we reach the woods,
we'll have the edge.

375
00:24:18,120 --> 00:24:20,440
We have King Bound with us, after all.

376
00:24:21,540 --> 00:24:23,220
The master of the forest.

377
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:25,640
It's King Bound! He's born!

378
00:24:25,860 --> 00:24:27,160
Boy, he's in a hurry!

379
00:24:27,380 --> 00:24:28,800
I wonder what gives!

380
00:24:29,040 --> 00:24:30,600
Out of my way!

381
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,030
Awesome!

382
00:24:38,660 --> 00:24:39,490
How far?

383
00:24:39,860 --> 00:24:40,940
That's sandy.

384
00:24:42,540 --> 00:24:43,370
Everyone!

385
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,240
Step aside! Sunny!

386
00:24:53,500 --> 00:24:55,060
Look! Guys!

387
00:24:55,280 --> 00:24:57,080
It's the sunny! Really?

388
00:24:57,480 --> 00:24:58,600
Right to the coast.

389
00:24:58,820 --> 00:25:00,055
It's a straight shot.

390
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:02,280
You are so spotless!

391
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:05,300
Nabi, way to go!

392
00:25:09,580 --> 00:25:13,140
As long as Big Mom isn't riding
on Zeus, we'll stay safe.

393
00:25:13,460 --> 00:25:14,931
The cloud's name is Zeus?

394
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:18,880
Yes, Big Mom created him
from a piece of her soul.

395
00:25:19,340 --> 00:25:20,657
Yep, that's me, all right.

396
00:25:20,740 --> 00:25:23,900
Act Lobby is Zeus! He's here! What now?

397
00:25:24,160 --> 00:25:25,780
Be strong, be wary.

398
00:25:26,320 --> 00:25:29,967
Hey, can I get some more of those
yummy little thunder clouds?

399
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,470
Huh?

400
00:25:34,553 --> 00:25:35,700
The black balls?

401
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:36,920
Were they tasty?

402
00:25:37,300 --> 00:25:40,829
Yeah, they were rich and tingly
and went down really smooth.

403
00:25:41,080 --> 00:25:42,460
Best I ever had.

404
00:25:42,740 --> 00:25:44,300
So, can I get some more?

405
00:25:44,700 --> 00:25:46,520
Clouds think clouds are yummy?

406
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:54,200
You're so fluffy.

407
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:57,060
Gimme, gimme, gimme. Pretty please?

408
00:25:58,220 --> 00:25:59,460
You can eat later.

409
00:25:59,640 --> 00:26:01,397
Forget that and let us ride you.

410
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:02,820
I can't.

411
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:07,800
You see, only Mama can because I
contain part of her soul. That's lame.

412
00:26:08,100 --> 00:26:10,080
Cloud, you suck. Boring.

413
00:26:11,220 --> 00:26:14,040
If you can't give us a
ride, how about this?

414
00:26:15,560 --> 00:26:17,913
How would you like to become my servant?

415
00:26:19,740 --> 00:26:20,570
Gladly!

416
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:23,200
She's talking to the Cloud, not you.

417
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:27,795
Then I'll use my blackball technique
to summon snacks for you every day!

418
00:26:28,180 --> 00:26:29,437
Huh? Really?

419
00:26:29,520 --> 00:26:31,000
What to do?

420
00:26:31,800 --> 00:26:34,160
I'm not the only one switching sides.

421
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:39,780
You know, it was so cool when you got
all big and covered up the whole sky.

422
00:26:40,140 --> 00:26:42,140
You could be the star of the show.

423
00:26:42,580 --> 00:26:44,280
Oh, wow, you think?

424
00:26:44,560 --> 00:26:48,020
Mama never compliments me
like that or gives me snacks.

425
00:26:48,920 --> 00:26:51,200
Where is my cake?

426
00:27:13,600 --> 00:27:15,880
Listen up, seducing wards.

427
00:27:17,220 --> 00:27:18,050
No!

428
00:27:18,180 --> 00:27:20,062
Let's not get past to the coast!

429
00:27:32,620 --> 00:27:33,450
She's...angry!

430
00:27:37,220 --> 00:27:39,180
The forest got annoying again!

431
00:27:40,080 --> 00:27:41,140
What's the deal?

432
00:27:41,320 --> 00:27:43,908
Can't we just kick the
trees out of the way?

433
00:27:44,420 --> 00:27:45,440
I wish,

434
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:47,537
but if we rampage around in there,

435
00:27:47,620 --> 00:27:50,937
all the trees will move and we
won't know where we are anymore!

436
00:27:51,020 --> 00:27:51,850
Indeed.

437
00:27:51,933 --> 00:27:54,369
The purpose of this
forest is to disorient.

438
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:05,600
Unfortunately, Mama
outranks my own authority.

439
00:28:12,260 --> 00:28:13,120
Who's yet?

440
00:28:15,700 --> 00:28:17,700
I'm coming! Make me free!

441
00:28:18,540 --> 00:28:20,400
We're back! That's right!

442
00:28:20,660 --> 00:28:23,080
Run for your love and for your future!

443
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:27,520
We're Mama's orders! Stop them!

444
00:28:29,220 --> 00:28:32,380
I'm not going to the
Lumberyard, not today!

445
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:34,860
Why are you doing this team now?

446
00:28:38,580 --> 00:28:40,840
Almost there! Keep pushing!

447
00:28:44,740 --> 00:28:47,700
Find something to hang on to! Tree!

448
00:28:48,120 --> 00:28:49,160
Nice work!

449
00:28:50,600 --> 00:28:52,520
And Gum-Gum!

450
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:20,480
Wow, that's convenient.

451
00:29:24,060 --> 00:29:26,457
Why is it so hot? No.

452
00:29:26,540 --> 00:29:27,760
Dammit.

453
00:29:39,840 --> 00:29:41,520
Pickles got real big.

454
00:29:42,160 --> 00:29:43,680
He must be mad.

455
00:29:45,620 --> 00:29:47,060
Hey, King Bomb, stop.

456
00:29:50,300 --> 00:29:52,900
Tell me, why did you betray Mama?

457
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:57,220
It's complicated, okay?

458
00:29:57,980 --> 00:29:59,100
It burns!

459
00:30:00,280 --> 00:30:01,760
What should we do?

460
00:30:02,540 --> 00:30:04,520
Are we trying to crush us?

461
00:30:04,740 --> 00:30:06,446
Come on, King Balm, run away!

462
00:30:13,420 --> 00:30:14,880
Go, King Balm!

463
00:30:15,100 --> 00:30:15,940
Hurry up!

464
00:30:16,520 --> 00:30:18,560
You have to do it for your fiancé!

465
00:30:24,500 --> 00:30:26,200
Let's go! He can't move!

466
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:40,120
Run away!

467
00:30:40,600 --> 00:30:42,140
Nami, come on!

468
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:43,300
Get back!

469
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:45,520
He'll burn you, Karoo, too! Nami!

470
00:30:52,900 --> 00:30:53,740
That's me!

471
00:30:54,280 --> 00:30:55,110
I! I!

472
00:31:01,540 --> 00:31:02,400
Weee!

473
00:31:04,540 --> 00:31:06,160
King Belf, no!

474
00:31:07,900 --> 00:31:08,800
You can't!

475
00:31:10,260 --> 00:31:11,090
Ah!

476
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:14,510
Ah!

477
00:31:22,500 --> 00:31:23,330
Strawhead,

478
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:24,990
give me.

479
00:31:25,073 --> 00:31:26,700
my cake.

480
00:31:31,260 --> 00:31:32,360
Where's Betty?

481
00:31:32,660 --> 00:31:34,248
We'll catch up to him soon.

482
00:31:34,560 --> 00:31:37,325
I noticed there's a fire
in the seducing woods.

483
00:31:37,700 --> 00:31:39,524
I think Mama is fighting there.

484
00:31:40,420 --> 00:31:43,300
Mont d 'Or, this is Barrel
in the Mirror World.

485
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:45,580
We have 10,000 troops ready.

486
00:31:51,600 --> 00:31:52,430
Perfect.

487
00:31:52,620 --> 00:31:53,679
We'll be in touch.

488
00:31:55,560 --> 00:31:57,620
Candy. Biscuit. Nuts.

489
00:31:58,020 --> 00:32:00,077
Prepare battleships from your islands.

490
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:01,877
And keep an eye on the southwest coast.

491
00:32:01,960 --> 00:32:03,877
where the Straw Hat ship is moored.

492
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:05,617
Do not let them raise anchor.

493
00:32:05,700 --> 00:32:06,580
Yes, sir!

494
00:32:07,020 --> 00:32:09,902
Your blockade will be the
first hurdle they face.

495
00:32:11,080 --> 00:32:15,786
Tart ships from Flavor Island and Liqueur
Island will be positioned further out.

496
00:32:16,460 --> 00:32:19,100
Get ready and remain
on standby at the port.

497
00:32:19,800 --> 00:32:23,506
Move in once you get a warning
signal from the Territory Slugs.

498
00:32:23,760 --> 00:32:24,590
Roger.

499
00:32:27,100 --> 00:32:31,840
They may have avoided the Slugs on the
way in, but this time they're dead.

500
00:32:37,180 --> 00:32:39,400
The forest is noisy today.

501
00:32:39,780 --> 00:32:41,000
That's no surprise.

502
00:32:42,340 --> 00:32:46,164
Mama is chasing down the Straw
Hats personally, so it's unlikely,

503
00:32:46,420 --> 00:32:48,900
no, impossible that they'll make it here.

504
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:51,260
A safe bet.

505
00:32:51,520 --> 00:32:54,580
So, uh, why are we setting up an ambush?

506
00:32:56,040 --> 00:32:57,500
Just in case.

507
00:33:02,900 --> 00:33:07,460
Hey, you get the Dark tanks,
couldn't just let me go. Fire!

508
00:33:11,220 --> 00:33:13,220
We're nearly at the coast, though.

509
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:15,420
Banshee, stop! Whoa!

510
00:33:15,920 --> 00:33:16,920
You startled me!

511
00:33:18,040 --> 00:33:20,120
Sorry, doll. Back off.

512
00:33:20,620 --> 00:33:23,160
Lady or not, I will shoot you.

513
00:33:23,340 --> 00:33:25,257
I'm only here to talk to Chiffon.

514
00:33:25,340 --> 00:33:27,420
I need to see her immediately.

515
00:33:29,860 --> 00:33:31,360
Chiffon, where are you?

516
00:33:34,500 --> 00:33:35,330
Pudding?

517
00:33:35,413 --> 00:33:37,660
What's all this about? There you are.

518
00:33:38,040 --> 00:33:40,452
There's a problem only you can help with.

519
00:33:40,960 --> 00:33:43,784
Mama's been hit with
another hunger pang attack.

520
00:33:44,760 --> 00:33:47,300
This time, she wants a wedding cake.

521
00:33:48,100 --> 00:33:50,260
You said a hunger pang attack?

522
00:33:50,560 --> 00:33:54,800
Well, because the cake that she wants
happens to be chocolate chiffon.

523
00:33:55,220 --> 00:33:57,720
So you understand why I need you?

524
00:33:59,260 --> 00:34:00,090
Hmm.

525
00:34:00,173 --> 00:34:04,160
Because my chiffon cakes are
the best cakes. That's right.

526
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:05,917
And my chocolate is the best.

527
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:07,800
So if we combine our talents,

528
00:34:07,940 --> 00:34:10,977
we could make a cake that
easily satisfies Mama's craving.

529
00:34:11,060 --> 00:34:13,236
Hopefully before any more people die.

530
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:14,940
We have to stop her now!

531
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:17,220
Please, Chiffon, you must!

532
00:34:25,060 --> 00:34:26,460
I'm sorry, Pudding.

533
00:34:26,720 --> 00:34:29,249
I'm leaving this family
just like Lola did.

534
00:34:29,580 --> 00:34:33,992
I can't be burdened by Mama anymore,
or worry about the people here either.

535
00:34:34,640 --> 00:34:37,520
She's done. Now go. You heard her.

536
00:34:38,060 --> 00:34:39,531
You've got it wrong, huh?

537
00:34:46,140 --> 00:34:48,640
I don't care about saving Mama.

538
00:34:48,980 --> 00:34:51,921
And I don't care what
happens to Toto Land either.

539
00:34:56,060 --> 00:34:59,220
I need to stop Mama before it's too late.

540
00:35:00,760 --> 00:35:02,497
I know she'll kill him.

541
00:35:02,580 --> 00:35:05,840
She'll murder Sanji and his friends too!
